  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for support to strengthen ACET&apos;s Gender Equality program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a pan-African economic policy institute, the African Center for Economic Transformation (ACET) supports sustainable and resilient growth in Africa. Through its Gender Equality program, ACET embeds a gender lens to unearth gender issues and to develop gender-responsive policy recommendations with the aim that this focus will, over time, condition policymakers to adopt a gender-responsive approach in macroeconomic and microeconomic policy development. Over the next few years, the Gender Equality program aims to grow into a center of excellence at the intersection of gender and economic policymaking in Africa. This flexible program grant will enable ACET to deepen these focal areas, including sustained, meaningful engagement with policy actors and civil society. (Strategy: Women&apos;s Economic Empowerment)</narrative>
  </description>
